What I Learned – Weight Conversion Calculator in C

Today, I created a Weight Conversion Calculator using the C programming language.

Through this program, I learned:


How to perform mathematical operations like multiplication and division.
How to convert kilograms into pounds and pounds into kilograms.
How to handle invalid user choices.

Conversion Formulas

Kilograms to Pounds: kilograms * 2.20462
Pounds to Kilograms: pounds / 2.20462

Project Goal

To understand basic C programming concepts and improve my problem-solving skills by building a simple interactive calculator.

